{"title": "Bibberbang Spores", "pageid": 27855, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Bibberbang_Spores", "categories": ["Class actions", "Ranged spell attacks", "Actions", "Sources of Poison damage"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Bibberbang_Spores.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fc/Bibberbang_Spores.webp/300px-Bibberbang_Spores.webp, /w/images/f/fc/Bibberbang_Spores.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fc/Bibberbang_Spores.webp/300px-Bibberbang_Spores.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fc/Bibberbang_Spores.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure><b>Bibberbang Spores</b> is a special class action available from the <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-very-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Armour_of_the_Sporekeeper\" title=\"Armour of the Sporekeeper\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b3/Armour_of_Landfall_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Armour_of_Landfall_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b3/Armour_of_Landfall_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Armour_of_Landfall_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b3/Armour_of_Landfall_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Armour_of_Landfall_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b3/Armour_of_Landfall_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Armour_of_Landfall_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b3/Armour_of_Landfall_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Armour_of_the_Sporekeeper\" title=\"Armour of the Sporekeeper\">Armour of the Sporekeeper</a> with <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Symbiotic_Entity\" title=\"Symbiotic Entity\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/16/Symbiotic_Entity_Icon.webp/20px-Symbiotic_Entity_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/16/Symbiotic_Entity_Icon.webp/30px-Symbiotic_Entity_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/16/Symbiotic_Entity_Icon.webp/40px-Symbiotic_Entity_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Symbiotic Entity\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/16/Symbiotic_Entity_Icon.webp/20px-Symbiotic_Entity_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/16/Symbiotic_Entity_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Symbiotic_Entity\" title=\"Symbiotic Entity\">Symbiotic Entity</a> active.\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\nEject poisonous bibberbang spores and create a cloud of <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Noxious_Fumes\" title=\"Noxious Fumes\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/76/Noxious_Fumes_cloud_Icon.webp/25px-Noxious_Fumes_cloud_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/76/Noxious_Fumes_cloud_Icon.webp/38px-Noxious_Fumes_cloud_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/76/Noxious_Fumes_cloud_Icon.webp/50px-Noxious_Fumes_cloud_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Noxious Fumes\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/76/Noxious_Fumes_cloud_Icon.webp/25px-Noxious_Fumes_cloud_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/76/Noxious_Fumes_cloud_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Noxious_Fumes\" title=\"Noxious Fumes\">Noxious Fumes</a>.<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<dl><dt>Cost</dt>\n<dd><span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/28px-Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/42px-Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/28px-Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Actions#Resources\" title=\"Actions\">Action</a></dd><dt>Damage: 3~9</dt><dd class=\"bg3wiki-damage-display\" style=\"margin-left:0px\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;width:fit-content\"><span style=\"display:block;position:relative;width:30px;height:30px;margin-left:0px;padding-top:0px;margin-right:2px\"><span style=\"z-index:0;position:absolute;transform:translate( 0%, 0%)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8c/D4_Poison.png/31px-D4_Poison.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/8c/D4_Poison.png/46px-D4_Poison.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/8c/D4_Poison.png/62px-D4_Poison.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8c/D4_Poison.png/31px-D4_Poison.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"31\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/8/8c/D4_Poison.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><div><div style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-poison\">2d4 + 1</span><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Poison\" title=\"Poison\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/55/Poison_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Poison_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/55/Poison_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Poison_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/55/Poison_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Poison_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Poison\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/55/Poison_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Poison_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/55/Poison_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Poison\" title=\"Poison\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-poison\">Poison</span></a></div></div></div></dd>\n<dt>Details</dt>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/25px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/38px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/50px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Ranged Spell Attack Roll\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/25px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Ranged Spell <a href=\"/wiki/Attack_Roll\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Attack Roll\">Attack Roll</a></dd>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/25px-Range_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/38px-Range_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/0/08/Range_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Range: 18 m (60 ft)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/25px-Range_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/0/08/Range_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Range: 18 m (60 ft)</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png/25px-Aoe_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png/38px-Aoe_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"AoE: 2 m (7 ft) Radius\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png/25px-Aoe_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> AoE: 2 m (7 ft) Radius</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png/25px-Aoe_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png/38px-Aoe_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Creates Area: Noxious Fumes\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png/25px-Aoe_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Creates Area: Noxious Fumes</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/38px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png 2x\"><